that which they are committing.","j":8,"h":15,"s":6,"a":113,"sd":null},{"k":"6:114","t":"[Say], \"Then is it other than Allāh I should seek as judge while it is He who has revealed to you the Book [i.e., the Qur’ān] explained in detail?\" And those to whom We [previously] gave the Scripture know that it is sent down from your Lord in truth, so never be among the doubters.","j":8,"h":15,"s":6,"a":114,"sd":null},{"k":"6:115","t":"And the word of your Lord has been fulfilled in truth and in justice. None can alter His words, and He is the Hearing, the Knowing.","j":8,"h":15,"s":6,"a":115,"sd":null},{"k":"6:116","t":"And if you obey most of those upon the earth, they will mislead you from the way of Allāh. They follow not except assumption, and they are not but misjudging.","j":8,"h":15,"s":6,"a":116,"sd":null},{"k":"6:117","t":"Indeed, your Lord is most knowing of who strays from His way, and He is most knowing of the [rightly] guided.","j":8,"h":15,"s":6,"a":117,"sd":null},{"k":"6:118","t":"So eat of that [meat] upon which the name of Allāh has been mentioned, if you are believers in His verses [i.e., revealed law].","j":8,"h":15,"s":6,"a":118,"sd":null}],"juz":8,"hizb":15,"surahs":[6],"sajdah":false}